        <mxCell id="BQ5Er9MHmtifRlCAmKAv-27" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Throughput / optimization techniques:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. start with a wide field of view, use AI model for acquisition, then only take a threshold of the basler camera for higher FPS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. use optimized C++ or C blob detection algorithm, begin computing as soon as the bitstream arrives (pipelining).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. keep the blob detection and recording/distance measurements in seperate CPU cores, so they run in parallel, use all cores&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Potentially upgrade to better Rpi platform&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
